# Migrate existing bank accounts

Learn how to migrate existing bank accounts to the Payment Intents API or Checkout Sessions API.

## Index

This article has multiple variants. Fetch one of the following URLs to view specific content for your use case:

- [Checkout Sessions API](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/ach-direct-debit/migrating-from-charges.md?integration-path=checkout)
- [Payment Intents API](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/ach-direct-debit/migrating-from-charges.md?integration-path=payment-intent)
